= Gordon Treecaller =

You say, 'I choose Gordon Treecaller'
:''Ranger Spirit says 'Ahhh, Gordon Treecaller.  Many say he is the finest swordsman ever. Read of his tale and return the book (The Mother) when you are finished. ''
:''Ranger Spirit says 'Gordon Treecaller, I summon thee. ''
:''Gordon Treecaller says 'I, Gordon Treecaller, bid you good day. ''
:''Ranger Spirit says 'Good luck, my friend. ''
You say, 'hail Gordon Treecaller'
:''Gordon Treecaller says 'Hello, Xekl , I can only hope that my disturbance was necessary. Ahh, you seem to be decently adept with a blade. Would you like to be tested in the element of thunder, the blade, or the art of ranged attack?  Or have you already been tested and are looking for things to trade? ''
You say, 'I am looking for things to trade'
:''Gordon Treecaller says 'I am searching for the sword called Yannikil.  It seems when I gave this weapon out the blade did not perform as well in combat as it should.  I wish to fix this embarrassment and replace the blade with one tested and proven by my own hands. ''

